            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.87

- Swiping back on the artwork now reaches the previous song from anywhere in the current one. Players treat "previous" as "restart this track" once you are a few seconds in, so the first swipe only started the song again.
]]></description>
